---
source: crates/elasticctl-cli/tests/mcp.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(help.stdout).expect(\"help is UTF-8\")"
---
Serve MCP over stdin and stdout

Usage: elasticctl mcp serve [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --allow-query-tools  Enable the synchronous Elasticsearch query tools for this process
      --profile <PROFILE>  Use a named profile
      --config <CONFIG>    Use a specific configuration file
      --space <SPACE>      Kibana space to operate in
      --json               Force JSON output
      --format <FORMAT>    Output format: table, json, yaml, csv, jsonl
      --fields <FIELDS>    Comma-separated fields to include
      --out <OUT>          Write output to a file instead of stdout
  -y, --yes                Apply a mutation after reviewing its preview
      --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Request timeout in seconds
      --debug              Log HTTP requests and responses, with secrets redacted
  -h, --help               Print help
